      "es": "# Command 154 - Generate ISO/IEC 14888-3 Digital Signature using EC-SDSA\n\n- **Command ID:** `154`\n- **Title:** Generate ISO/IEC 14888-3 Digital Signature using EC-SDSA\n- **PDF Pages:** 929 - 931\n\n---\n\n\n<!-- Page 929 -->\n\n154 - Generate ISO/IEC 14888-3 Digital Signature using\nEC-SDSA\nCommand 154 generates an ISO/IEC 14888-3 digital signature as needed to support EMV using the Elliptic\nCurve Schnorr's Digital Signature Algorithm (EC-SDSA).\nReference Information: Section 9, “Asymmetric Cryptography.”\n| Key Type |  | Default Setting | MFK Type |\nAKB Disabled AES\nCommand\n\n```\n<154#Signature Algorithm#MSG#Private Key#>\n```\n\nResponse\n\n```\n<154#Digital Signature#Check Digits#>[CRLF]\n```\n\n\n### Command description\n\n| Field | Contents | Length | Description |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| Field | Contents   Length |  | Description |\n| 0 | Command identifier   3 |  | 154 |\n| 1 | Signature Algorithm   2 |  | The algorithm used to generate the message digest. |\n10 = EC-SDSA with SHA-256 using curve P-256\n11 = EC-SDSA with SHA-512 using curve P-521\nLegal Characters: 10, 11\n| 2 | MSG   2 - 4096 |  | Input data to be signed. |\nLegal Characters: 0-9, A-F\n| 3 | Private Key   Variable |  | The Private Key to sign the message. |\nHeaders Supported: AES MFK\n3peG*000, where * = E, N, or S.\nLegal Characters: Printable ASCII\n\n### Response description\n\n| Field | Contents | Length | Description |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| Field | Contents   Length |  | Description |\n| 0 | Response identifier   3 |  | 254 |\n| 1 | Digital Signature   128, 260 |  | The digital signature. The length of this field is 128 |\nhexadecimal characters when command field 1 is 10; it is 260\nhexadecimal characters when command field 1 is 11.\nLegal Characters: 0-9, A-F\n\n\n<!-- Page 930 -->\n\n\n### Response description (Continued)\n\n| Field | Contents | Length | Description |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| Field | Contents   Length |  | Description |\n| 2 | Check Digits   8 |  | The Private Key check digits are the leftmost eight |\nhexadecimal characters of the SHA-256 hash result of the\nPrivate Key.\nLegal Characters: 0-9, A-F\nAKB AES MFK Example\nThe AES Master File Key is:\n2ABC3DEF45670189 98107645FED3CBA2 0123456789ABCDEF FEDCBA9876543210\ncheck digits = B9BCAB7B62. See “AES Key (256-bit)” on page 1374 for component values.\n Private Key: A5483159423A754D46DC4ED22997686D8BA79AB978AB3FD42BA441B3AC58F9DF\n Message:\n15\n0000000002990000000000000056000000000009782304010011223344220100029F2701409F360\n200029F260839656889ABC1AFFC9F10200FA5019A3800000000000000000000000F01000000000\n0000000000000000000\n Random k: 3567EA2B31F08C2FD9D2F23D95F69EB565909889031A4607D255E649E9D8D824\n Public key point: 04||x||y\n04F0D3853D5417FDB5D4204193026B25935DB66A64B255C711F03E5C32FFC7894E\n6C180EE3B9D5453F70033F2C252B6E1A211FF072EDFC289093D51D6856C5CBA2\n kG: C5C431DFC0891E09D348251E4DC5966282246DCFDA3E81D0469D2DD573DC3776,\n15268168424E598A45E73425757FE28BE81A9582176E4555DC9599A570F27158\n kG in standard notation:\n04C5C431DFC0891E09D348251E4DC5966282246DCFDA3E81D0469D2DD573DC377615268168424E\n598A45E73425757FE28BE81A9582176E4555DC9599A570F27158\n The card computes r = SHA256(I2OS(x1, NFIELD)||MSG) mod n =\nSHA256(C5C431DFC0891E09D348251E4DC5966282246DCFDA3E81D0469D2DD573DC37761500000\n00002990000000000000056000000000009782304010011223344220100029F2701409F36020002\n9F260839656889ABC1AFFC9F10200FA5019A3800000000000000000000000F0100000000000000\n00000000000000) mod n =\n10DD8EC1D542F5362485EBF8EF71B99512CBE7361A3D453431CF5F64F58CA9B0\n The card computes rd mod n =\nC8647BACBE4231D95FF701831C5021539F10359C021ACC0D5EEB18048EA73CFF\n The card computes k+rd mod n =\nFDCC65D7F032BE0939C9F3C0B246C00904A0CE25053512153140FE4E78801523\n The XDA signature is S =\n(10DD8EC1D542F5362485EBF8EF71B99512CBE7361A3D453431CF5F64F58CA9B0,\nFDCC65D7F032BE0939C9F3C0B246C00904A0CE25053512153140FE4E78801523)\nThe command looks like this:\n\n\n<!-- Page 931 -->\n\n\n```\n<154#10#150000000002990000000000000056000000000009782304010011223344220100029F\n```\n\n2701409F360200029F260839656889ABC1AFFC9F10200FA5019A3800000000000000000000000F\n010000000000000000000000000000#3peGE000,00082A8648CE3D0301070020F0D3853D5417FD\nB5D4204193026B25935DB66A64B255C711F03E5C32FFC7894E00206C180EE3B9D5453F70033F2C\n252B6E1A211FF072EDFC289093D51D6856C5CBA231D0B5DEC161EFCBA6E4E40A8BC2FAF2843780\n77E7BF3C6584C18CE7ACDA8FAF0116,568D3901E2C82F25229F62C7D9D174C9#>\nThe HSM returns this response:\n\n```\n<254#10DD8EC1D542F5362485EBF8EF71B99512CBE7361A3D453431CF5F64F58CA9B0FDCC65D7F\n```\n\n032BE0939C9F3C0B246C00904A0CE25053512153140FE4E78801523#3FC92FAD#>\n\n",
