    "markdownDoc": {
      "es": "# Command 93 - Generate Random Number\n\n- **Command ID:** `93`\n- **Title:** Generate Random Number\n- **PDF Pages:** 523 - 524\n\n---\n\n\n<!-- Page 523 -->\n\n93 - Generate Random Number\nCommand 93 generates a random hexadecimal or decimal number.\n| Key Type |  | Default Setting | MFK Type |\nAKB Enabled 3DES, AES\n| 🟪 Variant |  | Enabled | 3DES |\nCommand\n\n```\n<93#[Format#Length#]>\n```\n\nResponse\n\n```\n<A3#Random Number#>\n```\n\n\n### Command description\n\n| Field | Contents | Length | Description |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\nColors specific to key management method: No color = AKB & Variant = AKB = Variant\n| Field | Contents | Length | Description |\n| 0 | Command identifier | 2 | 93 |\n| 1 | [Format#] | 1 | The format of the random number. This field contains an |\nuppercase letter, where:\nD = decimal\nH = hexadecimal\nIf this field is empty, the random number is in hexadecimal\nformat.\nLegal Characters: D, H\n| 2 | [Length#] | 1 - 3 | The length of the value to generate, 4-512. |\nIf this field is empty, the length of the random number is 16\ndigits.\nLegal Characters: 0-9\n\n### Response description\n\n| Field | Contents | Length | Description |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\nColors specific to key management method: No color = AKB & Variant = AKB = Variant\n| Field | Contents | Length | Description |\n| 0 | Response identifier | 2 | A3 |\n| 1 | 00 | 1 - 512 | The random number. |\nLegal Characters: 0-9, A-F\n\n\n<!-- Page 524 -->\n\nUsage Notes\n Fields one and two are optional, however field 2 cannot exist without field 1. If both fields are omitted,\nthe command generates 16 hexadecimal characters.\nExamples\nThis command generates a random value, your results will be different.\nGenerate a Random Number without Specifying Format or Length\nThe command looks like this:\n\n```\n<93#>\n```\n\nThe HSM returns this response:\n\n```\n<A3#A23D79FEDB1329AB#>\n```\n\nGenerate a Four Digit Random Hexadecimal Number\nThe command looks like this:\n\n```\n<93#H#4#>\n```\n\nThe HSM returns this response:\n\n```\n<A3#1A7B#>\n```\n\nGenerate a Six Digit Random Decimal Number\nThe command looks like this:\n\n```\n<93#D#6#>\n```\n\nThe HSM returns this response:\n\n```\n<A3#327179#>\n```\n\n\n",
      "en": "# Command 93 - Generate Random Number\n\n- **Command ID:** `93`\n- **Title:** Generate Random Number\n- **PDF Pages:** 523 - 524\n\n---\n\n\n<!-- Page 523 -->\n\n93 - Generate Random Number\nCommand 93 generates a random hexadecimal or decimal number.\n| Key Type |  | Default Setting | MFK Type |\nAKB Enabled 3DES, AES\n| 🟪 Variant |  | Enabled | 3DES |\nCommand\n\n```\n<93#[Format#Length#]>\n```\n\nResponse\n\n```\n<A3#Random Number#>\n```\n\n\n### Command description\n\n| Field | Contents | Length | Description |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\nColors specific to key management method: No color = AKB & Variant = AKB = Variant\n| Field | Contents | Length | Description |\n| 0 | Command identifier | 2 | 93 |\n| 1 | [Format#] | 1 | The format of the random number. This field contains an |\nuppercase letter, where:\nD = decimal\nH = hexadecimal\nIf this field is empty, the random number is in hexadecimal\nformat.\nLegal Characters: D, H\n| 2 | [Length#] | 1 - 3 | The length of the value to generate, 4-512. |\nIf this field is empty, the length of the random number is 16\ndigits.\nLegal Characters: 0-9\n\n### Response description\n\n| Field | Contents | Length | Description |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\nColors specific to key management method: No color = AKB & Variant = AKB = Variant\n| Field | Contents | Length | Description |\n| 0 | Response identifier | 2 | A3 |\n| 1 | 00 | 1 - 512 | The random number. |\nLegal Characters: 0-9, A-F\n\n\n<!-- Page 524 -->\n\nUsage Notes\n Fields one and two are optional, however field 2 cannot exist without field 1. If both fields are omitted,\nthe command generates 16 hexadecimal characters.\nExamples\nThis command generates a random value, your results will be different.\nGenerate a Random Number without Specifying Format or Length\nThe command looks like this:\n\n```\n<93#>\n```\n\nThe HSM returns this response:\n\n```\n<A3#A23D79FEDB1329AB#>\n```\n\nGenerate a Four Digit Random Hexadecimal Number\nThe command looks like this:\n\n```\n<93#H#4#>\n```\n\nThe HSM returns this response:\n\n```\n<A3#1A7B#>\n```\n\nGenerate a Six Digit Random Decimal Number\nThe command looks like this:\n\n```\n<93#D#6#>\n```\n\nThe HSM returns this response:\n\n```\n<A3#327179#>\n```\n\n\n"
    },
